  m_text: "To everyone who played, tested, supported, shared feedback, and stayed
    with this project along the way \u2014 thank you.\n\nFateful Rush was built one
    level, one challenge, and one breakthrough at a time.\n\nReaching the end means
    more than completing 40 missions. It means being part of the journey that brought
    this game to life.\n\nYour time, support, and belief made this possible.\n\nThe
    stars may have gone silent, but the rush lives on."
